1
00:01:55,935 --> 00:02:09,384
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:15,039
Alps, stop.

3
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,199
Drop your swords.

4
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:24,959
You can not leave here alive.

5
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,679
Osman Bey.

6
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:11,839
Welcome, Osman Bey.

7
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:15,119
I was waiting for you.

8
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:51,159
I know men like you.

9
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:57,839
That is why I was sure you would come here.

10
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,839
I told you to drop your swords.

11
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:15,879
What will we do, Konur Bey?

12
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:19,719
Will we surrender to these dogs?

13
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:24,759
I will never drop my sword.

14
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:31,719
Nokers, shoot on my command!

15
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:51,119
It seems our destiny is to
be martyrs together, brothers.

16
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:56,519
However, I won't fall..

17
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,999
..before taking couple of these out.

18
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:13,959
You know why I am here!

19
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:37,679
For Princess Maria. And,
of course, for Karacelasun.

20
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:45,719
First, give me what I own. So that we may discuss.

21
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:53,999
What about Elcim Hatun, whose
mother and father you killed?

22
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:57,919
Elcim.

23
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:03,679
Do you have Elcim Hatun?

24
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:08,279
Alps!

25
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:11,559
Bring Elcim Hatun.

26
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,399
What is it?

27
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:28,799
When you heard her name
and learned she is with us..

28
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:32,079
..you looked shocked.

29
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:36,279
You come to Osman Bey’s
palace without fear, however..

30
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:39,279
..you are afraid of a young girl?

31
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:53,039
Let go.

32
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:58,679
You liar. You are not Tajeddin Noyan.

33
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:02,959
Do you wish for your death, Hatun?

34
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:08,039
He is wasting our time.

35
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:15,599
He is not Tajeddin Noyan.

36
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:21,759
Alaeddin, arrest his dogs outside.

37
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:26,239
Come on.

38
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:04,399
Handle it without spilling blood.

39
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:33,119
Alps! Arrest the nokers!

40
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,879
Put these dogs to prison!

41
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:13,999
If something happens to my father..

42
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:20,039
..I will send the heads of
these dogs to Tajeddin Noyan.

43
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:33,999
Karacelasun got caught to lure you to me.

44
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:51,919
So you fell into my trap.

45
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:58,439
Nokers!

46
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,599
Stop!

47
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,439
Alps, drop your weapons.

48
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:17,319
-What are you saying, Konur Bey?
-Do as I say.

49
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:20,959
If they intended to kill, they
would've done so long ago.

50
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:27,199
Osman Bey is still inside. It
seems there is something else.

51
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,839
Drop your swords, come on.

52
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:05,399
I won't care for your nokers
and butcher you in half right here.

53
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:08,639
No, Osman Bey.

54
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:12,279
You won't do such a thing..

55
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:15,719
..as I haven't killed you yet.

56
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:19,999
Look here.

57
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:25,799
What is your intention?

58
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:31,759
I came here to make an agreement in peace.

59
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:36,759
However, if you intend to do otherwise..

60
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:40,919
..none of us will leave here alive.

61
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,039
So you have the heart to do this.

62
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:53,199
I have a great heart, Osman Bey.

63
00:11:55,960 --> 00:12:00,359
To show you my good intentions..

64
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:05,359
..I allow the others to go outside.

65
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:13,119
So that we may talk alone.

66
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,879
you want to talk with me..

67
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:20,279
..first, Elcim Hatun's family will come here.

68
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:24,239
We will see if they’re alive
or not. Then we will talk.

69
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:32,319
I knew you would want this. So I brought them.

70
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,079
You may leave.

71
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:43,399
Come on.

72
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,679
Now I will hear you.

73
00:12:56,880 --> 00:13:04,079
What I'm about to say will be in
favor of both Kayis and llhanids.

74
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:19,679
Father.

75
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:24,639
Aunt.

76
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,959
Father!

77
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,719
-Father!
-My Elcim!

78
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:34,639
Let go!

79
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:36,719
-Father!
-Hatun!

80
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,359
-Elcim.
-Father!

81
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:40,799
-My daughter!
-Let my father go!

82
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,199
Elcim Hatun!

83
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:48,279
Stay calm! Don't act with anger.

84
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:53,439
My mother is dead, my brother is dead.
How can you tell me not to be angry?

85
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:56,359
If you're afraid, stand back, son of Bey.

86
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,719
-Father!
-My daughter!

87
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:02,119
Hatun! Stop!

88
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:06,359
-Run, save yourself Elcim!
-My daughter, my Elcim!

89
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,359
I would stay at the hands of these dogs more..

90
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:14,119
..for you and for my tribe!
Why did you come my daughter?

91
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:17,399
I would've given my life if
needed! Why are you here?

92
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:20,719
How could I left you to your fate, father?

93
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:25,039
I am also not alone. Osman Bey is with me.

94
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:30,159
Did you say Osman Bey? Thank Allah.

95
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:37,959
These valiants, are they Osman Bey’s valiants?

96
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:43,359
They already fell to Tajeddin Noyan's trap!

97
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,079
Gunduz Bey.

98
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:53,279
My father Osman Bey, came
here considering all possibilities.

99
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:56,519
Do not worry. We will get you out of here.

100
00:14:56,680 --> 00:15:01,079
You, do not know how much of a tyrant..

101
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:06,119
..how vindictive, how cunning..

102
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:09,599
..this Tajeddin Noyan is!

103
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:14,119
That is why I am like this! Now he will kill..

104
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:18,599
..Osman Bey and his followers

105
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:24,239
You will give what you have.

106
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:28,279
-You want the Princess.
-Not only that..

107
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:32,079
..you will hand Karacelasun over to me.

108
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:38,799
Since sent his niece here..

109
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:43,039
..then this must not be the real
issue. Tell me what it really is.

110
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:47,719
That is preparing for a great expedition.

111
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:52,879
How big is it now, to reach as far as to us?

112
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:56,759
It will be an expedition
with big treasures and fame.

113
00:15:57,080 --> 00:16:00,199
Those who will participate
will double their fame..

114
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:04,639
..as well as their gold.

115
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:07,519
Tell me then.

116
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:12,999
Will they walk towards Memluks or to Golden Horde?

117
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:17,359
If you give your alps under our command..

118
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:20,199
..and act under us in this war..

119
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:25,919
..then you can learn.

120
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,319
Stop there.

121
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:34,039
Our alps only fight on Allah’s way.

122
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:38,279
It seems you and we do not share a common cause.

123
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:42,519
Know this well. I will not give..

124
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:46,199
..not a single alp under your command.

125
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:59,799
However, you did not hear
what you will have in return.

126
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:05,799
I will have my uncle..

127
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:09,239
..confirm that small personal beylik of yours..

128
00:17:09,319 --> 00:17:14,117
..in return of a small tax cost.

129
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:23,117
Look here, a beylik that needs to be confirmed..

130
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:25,999
..is neither free nor personal.

131
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:30,079
You only look for a beylik to feed until it dies.

132
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:34,519
Then, know that you are in wrong lands!

133
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:39,439
We never bowed down to anyone.

134
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:44,319
A lot of blood has been spilled for that.

135
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:47,479
We will spill it if needed, know that well.

136
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:51,879
you insist on this..

137
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:56,279
..you will see the side of
me that you never saw before.

138
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:03,079
And every child..

139
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:09,559
..every woman in your land pays the price of that.

140
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:20,119
There is no need for that, Osman Bey.
Noker!

141
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:29,039
Everyone who came with
Osman Bey are free to leave!

142
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,119
Now tell me.

143
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:51,279
Where is Osman Bey?

144
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:56,319
Osman is Great Tajeddin Noyan's guest.

145
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:01,079
Bala Hatun.

146
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:05,999
Don't break the tradition of visiting anymore.

147
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:09,559
Now Osman Bey’s life...

148
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:13,159
...depends on Tajeddin Noyan's mercy.

149
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:23,119
Your life depends on our
mercy! You inglorious dastard

150
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:27,799
You drew us into a trap, huh?

151
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:31,319
Get him up.

152
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:38,919
You used Karacelasun as a bait against us.

153
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:44,919
You can't compete with Amir Tajeddin's mind.

154
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:54,639
Baysungur, send the alps
after Osman Bey immediately.

155
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:57,719
Don’t even try.

156
00:19:57,960 --> 00:20:03,239
Nobody can get out of there alive as
long as Tajeddin Noyan doesn't want.

157
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:08,399
Your alps would be dead. Shahzade.

158
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:14,519
Put this dog in the dungeon.

159
00:20:27,760 --> 00:20:31,799
Get off! Leave me.

160
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:43,319
You'll take this woman and your alps and leave.

161
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:46,479
Your Bey will come after you.

162
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:00,879
Alps! Let's go.

163
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:04,399
I'm not going anywhere without my father and aunt!

164
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:07,519
If Osman Bey didn't have a
plan, he wouldn’t let us go.

165
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:10,599
He should tell about this plan. Besides,

166
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:15,399
What did he talk to Tajeddin Noyan and he lets
us go? I'm not going anywhere without them!

167
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,879
Daughter, enough

168
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:20,919
You go with them!
-I can't leave you here like this, father.

169
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:23,559
Knowing you’re fine makes us feel well.

170
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:25,879
-Just go!
-Come on, come on.

171
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,919
-Come on, dear.
-Father.

172
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,519
Go with them. Don't do anything crazy.

173
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:34,679
Look. Look at me.

174
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:37,119
You heard your father.

175
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:41,159
I know you're worried about your father and aunt.

176
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:46,399
But you should know Osman
Bey must have planned everything.

177
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:49,159
Otherwise, he wouldn't let us go.

178
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:52,519
We'll save both your father
and aunt with Allah's will.

179
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:55,159
But we need to go now.

180
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:02,919
Come on, alps!

181
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:13,359
-Father!
-Daughter!

182
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:16,999
-Don't do anything crazy, dear.
-Elcim!

183
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:21,719
-Elcim!
-My dear. Just go. dear! Go. Elcim

184
00:22:22,320 --> 00:22:24,119
My dear...

185
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:31,679
If these are your terms,

186
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:39,199
If you intend to make me a bey under your
command and make my soldiers your soldiers,

187
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:43,159
...the IIkhanid State will perform
their first campaign on me then.

188
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:46,159
The conditions will be better.

189
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:50,839
Things will change. Do not hurry.

190
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:53,879
Just think about it.

191
00:22:54,080 --> 00:22:56,879
It's not an easy matter.

192
00:22:57,200 --> 00:23:00,239
I have time. Now..

193
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:04,799
Leave calmly and go back to your land.

194
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:10,319
Tajeddin Noya

195
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:16,879
I'm expecting to see you in my dinner table...

196
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:19,759
...in Yenisehir tomorrow.

197
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:26,439
Come and we'll discuss everything in details.

198
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:31,919
You understand me. Let me understand you then.

199
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:39,599
Don't worry. There won't be a trap.

200
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:42,759
I'll be there.

201
00:23:42,960 --> 00:23:45,679
Stay safe, Osman Bey.

202
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:48,439
Stay safe.

203
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:06,679
Osman Bey... Praise be!

204
00:24:21,160 --> 00:24:24,359
Gunduz Bey who became captive...

205
00:24:25,360 --> 00:24:28,159
...to make his people free.

206
00:24:30,560 --> 00:24:36,119
Isn't a Bey’s duty protecting
his people, Osman Bey?

207
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:42,759
Isn't our primary goal their freedom?

208
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:48,919
It is. Of course it is. May Allah
send more people like you.

209
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:54,439
Don't be worrying. You didn't bow against them.

210
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:57,719
I won't let these dogs hunt you.

211
00:24:57,840 --> 00:25:02,279
Thank you, Osman Bey. Thank you.

212
00:25:02,720 --> 00:25:06,519
My time is over.

213
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:12,679
I have a great suffering. You
know what my only solace is?

214
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:18,439
My daughter being safe with you.

215
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:22,639
She brought soldiers here with her.

216
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:25,879
They fight under your command now.

217
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:33,359
I know your suffering. Don't
worry. You will find better solace.

218
00:25:35,080 --> 00:25:39,079
We’ll make them pay for this.

219
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:44,119
Look what I’m saying!

220
00:25:44,280 --> 00:25:48,359
I'm telling a Turkish Bey to give up. Huh.

221
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:55,719
For sure, your soldiers will come.
Your Beys will line up before you.

222
00:25:57,400 --> 00:26:01,239
Don't you lose your hopes.

223
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:08,479
Tell me. How did they make you fall?

224
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:10,839
We didn’t..

225
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:13,479
...let Olcaytu collect our alps.

226
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:18,239
But Tajeddin Noyan

227
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:21,479
...played different tricks and deceived us.

228
00:26:22,040 --> 00:26:28,199
He made my deceased son
and me turn against each other.

229
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:35,159
I buried my son while we were at odds.

230
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:38,959
Osman Bey... We were at odds.

231
00:26:40,360 --> 00:26:43,879
Then we got stuck between Konya and Tabriz.

232
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:48,959
They smashed us and we’ve ended up here.

233
00:26:52,840 --> 00:26:58,439
Listen, Osman Bey. Don't hang out with this dog.

234
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:01,199
This dog...

235
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:05,319
..is a demon speaking with the right tongue.

236
00:27:06,320 --> 00:27:09,999
And his tongue is even sharper than a dagger.

237
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:18,839
Nothing but killing would stop him.

238
00:27:19,320 --> 00:27:23,319
But just like our escape,

239
00:27:23,720 --> 00:27:26,319
...that's impossible.

240
00:27:40,120 --> 00:27:42,679
You think I will leave..

241
00:27:42,720 --> 00:27:45,759
...Hayme Mother’s children to these dogs?

242
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:51,239
Don't be worrying. By
either killing or stopping them,

243
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:54,239
...I will save you from this place.

244
00:27:55,120 --> 00:27:57,639
Thank you.

245
00:28:01,600 --> 00:28:04,759
I will crush Tajeddin Noyan

246
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:21,239
You brought me here for no
reason, Orhan Bey! I won't stop!

247
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:25,239
I won't stop! I will go back and take my father.

248
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:31,239
Hatun... Do as I say.

249
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:36,479
e will wait for my father's return.

250
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:40,479
Osman Bey won't be able to
stand against Tajeddin Noyan.

251
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:43,679
It's obvious. Let me go..

252
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:48,599
...and let me do it myself.
-Elcim Hatun!

253
00:29:49,080 --> 00:29:53,799
I told you, we will wait for my father's return!

254
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:58,959
What happened, Orhan?
What is happening here?

255
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:05,039
Where is Osman Bey?

256
00:30:05,960 --> 00:30:11,119
He is with Tajeddin Noyan. He
ordered us to come here before him.

257
00:30:11,520 --> 00:30:14,559
He will tell you everything when he comes back.

258
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:24,559
That Tajeddin Noyan used
Karacelasun as a bait on purpose.

259
00:30:24,680 --> 00:30:28,359
He was luring us into a game from the beginning.

260
00:30:30,000 --> 00:30:33,559
What kind of a snake is that?

261
00:30:35,280 --> 00:30:38,999
My father and my aunt are
still in the hands of that man!

262
00:30:39,080 --> 00:30:42,959
How can I stay here?
-You will stay, my daughter.

263
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:45,559
Your patience will be your weapon.

264
00:30:45,680 --> 00:30:48,775
Osman Bey will come, we
will understand the situation

265
00:30:48,787 --> 00:30:51,319
and what is necessary
will be done for sure.

266
00:30:55,160 --> 00:30:56,959
Come on.

267
00:30:57,120 --> 00:31:02,239
After you, Elcim Hatun. Come on.

268
00:33:25,960 --> 00:33:31,799
Nokers! Give some water to Gunduz Bey and Hatun.

269
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:41,679
They brought Kayis' Bey Osman to me.

270
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:51,639
We won't drink even a drop...

271
00:33:52,960 --> 00:33:56,559
...of your water.

272
00:33:58,200 --> 00:34:04,079
You will never be able to control Osman.

273
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:11,679
Do you understand? -Osman is a smart man.

274
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:17,559
Sooner or later, he will bow down to me.

275
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:21,239
If he doesn't...

276
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:28,879
...I will make him bow down.

277
00:34:34,639 --> 00:34:39,119
You will see. This time...

278
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:42,039
...your plans will not work.

279
00:34:42,120 --> 00:34:45,799
Tajeddin Noyan!

280
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:52,839
And then... I will cut your head off.

281
00:34:53,040 --> 00:34:56,839
You couldn't become any wiser.

282
00:34:58,200 --> 00:35:02,999
I killed people in your tribe, your Alps.

283
00:35:03,640 --> 00:35:08,279
I killed your wife and your son.

284
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:15,879
I thought you would become wiser.
-I did!

285
00:35:15,960 --> 00:35:21,279
I didi I will torture you until you die!

286
00:35:21,400 --> 00:35:25,319
I am wiser now!

287
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:30,639
Let's assume that you
don't show mercy to yourself.

288
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:34,999
But don't you show mercy to
this Hatun, the entrustment...

289
00:35:35,240 --> 00:35:38,199
..of your son

290
00:35:38,680 --> 00:35:44,279
I am honored that my Bey
does not bow to dogs and jackals.

291
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:50,959
Take me out of here, and
I will show youi Open this!

292
00:35:54,600 --> 00:36:00,479
Be patient. Soon, I will get what I want.

293
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:06,879
Then... you will also bow down.

294
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:16,439
Prepare my horse!

295
00:36:46,520 --> 00:36:49,359
-My father...
-My daughter..

296
00:36:49,680 --> 00:36:52,999
You are alright. You are alright, thanks to Allah.

297
00:36:53,160 --> 00:36:56,279
I am alright, I am alright. Don't worry.

298
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:59,479
I was afraid something was
going to happen to you, father.

299
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:02,519
No... don't be afraid. Who can hurt me?

300
00:37:02,800 --> 00:37:06,679
I never do something
before I make sure it is safe.

301
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:11,799
My Beyl Thanks to Allah, you are alright.

302
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:15,399
We are alright...
Thank Allah we are..

303
00:37:15,480 --> 00:37:18,799
Now, the helper under the
guise of Tajeddin Noyan...

304
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:21,639
...where is that dog?

305
00:37:23,720 --> 00:37:26,559
In the dungeon, my Bey.

306
00:37:28,160 --> 00:37:32,119
What happened to Gunduz Bey
and his daughter in law Ayca Hatun?

307
00:37:33,480 --> 00:37:37,359
Tajeddin Noyan does not want to give them to us.

308
00:37:38,160 --> 00:37:41,559
He wants to take without giving.

309
00:37:43,680 --> 00:37:47,239
Come on, I'll be waiting
for everyone at the council.

310
00:37:58,640 --> 00:38:02,199
Tajeddin Noyan set his eyes on Osman.

311
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:07,439
Today he tested him, but if he does
not obey tomorrow, he will destroy them.

312
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:19,639
Tajeddin Noyan does not let
others notice him before he...

313
00:38:19,640 --> 00:38:23,639
...gets his teeth into his prey.

314
00:38:24,600 --> 00:38:29,159
And he knows it is difficult to attack Osman.

315
00:38:31,640 --> 00:38:37,719
That dog must've set his game accordingly.

316
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:41,639
Osman Bey is the last chance of Kayis.

317
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:47,719
If he falls, Kayis will disappear.

318
00:38:49,600 --> 00:38:54,559
No... Kayi will exist forever.

319
00:38:55,840 --> 00:38:59,359
We will get out of this place in some way.

320
00:38:59,480 --> 00:39:05,039
And we will stand before that dog like lions.

321
00:39:05,640 --> 00:39:08,239
How many times have we tried, dad?

322
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:13,799
-Stop... I will not give up on
freeing myself from this captivity..

323
00:39:13,920 --> 00:39:18,119
...and rescuing my tribe...

324
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:20,999
...and my daughter.

325
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:26,079
Being trapped here like this...

326
00:39:26,160 --> 00:39:29,239
..hurts me.

327
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:33,479
I will either confront that dog...

328
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:35,719
...and kill him...

329
00:39:36,160 --> 00:39:38,999
...or die with honor.

330
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:45,359
But not like this.

331
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:48,559
Not like this.

332
00:39:49,080 --> 00:39:53,319
Olcaytu Khan is getting ready
for a war. He wants Alps from us.

333
00:39:53,520 --> 00:39:58,159
But his real intention is to weaken our power.

334
00:39:58,360 --> 00:40:00,439
They don't want anyone to get stronger...

335
00:40:00,440 --> 00:40:03,919
...in these lands after the Seljuks.

336
00:40:04,040 --> 00:40:09,119
They will lead us into a war and feed the
Byzantines with us at our weakest moment.

337
00:40:09,200 --> 00:40:12,039
Of course, if we bow down.

338
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:17,039
Gunduz Bey did not bow down.

339
00:40:17,280 --> 00:40:21,599
That's why they started by attacking his tribe.

340
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:27,639
So, what path do you think
we should follow, my Bey?

341
00:40:32,480 --> 00:40:35,839
Tajeddiri Noyan

342
00:40:37,040 --> 00:40:39,719
...hides his iron fist...

343
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:43,519
...behind a velvet glove.

344
00:40:44,120 --> 00:40:50,879
I have invited him to my table to gain time.

345
00:40:52,480 --> 00:40:55,839
Why are you trying to gain time, Osman Bey?

346
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:59,519
For the great war I will start.

347
00:41:03,520 --> 00:41:06,319
Now...

348
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:13,359
...send news to all the Beys, to all the tribes.

349
00:41:13,520 --> 00:41:17,679
We are entering a new war.

350
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:21,279
Let them know that this war is very important...

351
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:24,599
...for the future of the Turks.

352
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:27,399
But before that...

353
00:41:27,480 --> 00:41:33,199
...we will go to Tajeddin Noyan's headquarters
to take Gunduz Bey and Ayca Hatun.

354
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:36,399
They are from Kayi tribe...

355
00:41:36,560 --> 00:41:41,679
...and Hayme mother's lineage.
They are our grace and honour.

356
00:41:41,800 --> 00:41:47,759
If we let them take someone
from us, how will others trust us?

357
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:53,879
How are we going to take my
father and my aunt from them?

358
00:41:56,920 --> 00:42:01,839
I placed Turahan at the
headquarters of Tajeddin Noyan...

359
00:42:01,920 --> 00:42:05,159
...as a spy when we went there.

360
00:42:06,240 --> 00:42:09,199
My Bey... Is it enough for
us to have a spy inside?

361
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:11,479
How will we carry out the attack there?

362
00:42:11,640 --> 00:42:14,599
That place is Tajeddin
Noyan's captive headquarters.

363
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:17,919
He brought him there to show that he was alive...

364
00:42:18,040 --> 00:42:22,799
But he will take them to his actual headquarters.

365
00:42:23,480 --> 00:42:27,759
It will be enough for us if our spy Turahan
informs us about this, right, my Bey?

366
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:30,079
Are we going to save them on the way?

367
00:42:30,320 --> 00:42:33,519
Taking your family from him will not weaken...

368
00:42:33,720 --> 00:42:36,159
...his power.

369
00:42:38,240 --> 00:42:42,679
He will surely demand a dog from these lands.

370
00:42:42,800 --> 00:42:46,519
He will want to take whoever...

371
00:42:46,760 --> 00:42:49,279
..hates us the most.

372
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:52,719
He will talk to Mehmet Bey, my Bey.

373
00:42:54,120 --> 00:43:00,079
And he will celebrate it, my Bey. He has
been trying to attack us for a long time.

374
00:43:02,800 --> 00:43:05,159
He can't do anything.

375
00:43:05,480 --> 00:43:09,039
Since I placed Cerkutay by his side...

376
00:43:09,360 --> 00:43:12,359
...I have been controlling his leash.

377
00:43:44,680 --> 00:43:49,319
Move, you mani Why are you
standing in the middle of the way?

378
00:43:50,880 --> 00:43:53,479
Don't you hear us?
I am talking to you!

379
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:11,119
Move!

380
00:45:35,880 --> 00:45:40,359
A man who dares to confront me like this...

381
00:45:40,720 --> 00:45:43,399
...must be counting on something.

382
00:45:46,360 --> 00:45:49,799
Tell me. Who are you?

383
00:46:04,280 --> 00:46:09,279
You are the famous Executioner of Byzantine, huh?

384
00:46:11,840 --> 00:46:13,919
Turcopole?

385
00:46:15,160 --> 00:46:17,679
Imren Tegin.

386
00:46:27,680 --> 00:46:29,679
As he forgave the trouble-maker...

387
00:46:29,800 --> 00:46:33,919
...who worked with Templars and raided Thrace,

388
00:46:34,360 --> 00:46:38,119
...Andronikos must be so desperate.

389
00:46:38,400 --> 00:46:41,279
He sent me...

390
00:46:41,480 --> 00:46:44,959
...because he didn't want you
to stay helpless against Osman...

391
00:46:44,960 --> 00:46:48,759
...after Geyhatu, Nayman and Gorklu Khan.

392
00:46:49,880 --> 00:46:55,039
We trust the help of the helpless, Imren Tegin.

393
00:46:56,160 --> 00:47:00,399
What did your emperor promise you?

394
00:47:00,800 --> 00:47:05,759
I will own the castles in the
border in return for Osman's head.

395
00:47:06,600 --> 00:47:10,719
What if I don’t want Osman's head?

396
00:47:10,840 --> 00:47:14,239
You don’t want Osman's head

397
00:47:14,360 --> 00:47:18,919
Tell me then. You want him to take your head?

398
00:47:19,240 --> 00:47:24,999
I have no intention to
destroy Osman or Kayi people.

399
00:47:25,440 --> 00:47:29,679
Are you planning to take Turks under your command?

400
00:47:30,840 --> 00:47:34,959
You don't know us, Tajeddin
Noyan. Don't forget this.

401
00:47:35,120 --> 00:47:40,239
I'm a Turk too. Turks will never obey you.

402
00:47:40,240 --> 00:47:42,719
Like I didn't obey the emperor.

403
00:47:42,800 --> 00:47:48,759
Do you know how to tame a
pack of wolves, Imren Tegin?

404
00:47:49,480 --> 00:47:51,759
If you put wolves in a cage,

405
00:47:51,760 --> 00:47:54,679
...they never obey you.

406
00:47:54,840 --> 00:47:59,999
You need to tame them in their natural habitat.

407
00:48:01,840 --> 00:48:06,119
Without scaring, without annoying.

408
00:48:06,560 --> 00:48:08,999
Slowly.

409
00:48:09,080 --> 00:48:14,559
Will you send the wolves you turn
into dogs against your enemies?

410
00:48:15,600 --> 00:48:18,399
Your Sultan Olcaytu is seeing a dream.

411
00:48:18,400 --> 00:48:21,399
What if the pack gather
and cause a trouble for you?

412
00:48:21,560 --> 00:48:24,079
As long as we don't want,

413
00:48:24,240 --> 00:48:28,159
...nobody can cause a trouble
for anybody, Imren Tegin.

414
00:48:30,560 --> 00:48:33,959
If they disobey the high order,

415
00:48:34,000 --> 00:48:38,639
...then I will take Osman’s head.

416
00:48:40,320 --> 00:48:45,039
You think you can take Osman’s head on your own?

417
00:49:30,640 --> 00:49:32,639
My Bey.

418
00:49:32,920 --> 00:49:37,199
What about the princess?
How long will we keep her here?

419
00:49:37,800 --> 00:49:40,239
Princess..

420
00:49:40,360 --> 00:49:45,719
It's time for Princess now. She'll
be captured by Tajeddin Noyan.

421
00:49:46,000 --> 00:49:50,639
And she'll bring information
from there as our spy.

422
00:49:51,000 --> 00:49:53,559
And we will keep our promise.

423
00:49:53,640 --> 00:49:56,279
Osman Bey.

424
00:49:56,680 --> 00:50:02,119
You're talking about your
plans. The princess, a spy...

425
00:50:02,200 --> 00:50:05,639
You say you'll save my family.
It's okay so far...

426
00:50:05,760 --> 00:50:10,119
But you never mention
Tajeddin Noyan's lifeless head!

427
00:50:15,720 --> 00:50:18,519
Girl.

428
00:50:21,120 --> 00:50:24,159
I know you're furious.

429
00:50:24,440 --> 00:50:29,199
But you can't act with ambition during a fight.

430
00:50:30,680 --> 00:50:34,239
We're trying to act in the right way.

431
00:50:34,240 --> 00:50:37,319
-Osman Bey!
-Elcim Hatuni

432
00:50:39,560 --> 00:50:43,559
You're in Osman Bey's presence. Know your place.

433
00:50:45,360 --> 00:50:49,559
We're struggling for your
and your family's health.

434
00:51:01,000 --> 00:51:03,759
Malhun.

435
00:51:11,040 --> 00:51:14,439
We did everything that we can do with minds.

436
00:51:14,720 --> 00:51:19,079
The rest is up to courage and strength.

437
00:51:20,400 --> 00:51:25,599
Send messages to all the
beysj I’m declaring mobilization.

438
00:51:26,040 --> 00:51:31,079
We'll either vanish or as a great state,

439
00:51:31,200 --> 00:51:34,159
...we'll get rid of this trouble.

440
00:51:45,480 --> 00:51:48,159
You yourself should wrap your own wounds.

441
00:51:48,400 --> 00:51:51,239
Nobody can help you.

442
00:51:56,560 --> 00:52:01,279
Elcim, are you available?

443
00:52:09,280 --> 00:52:12,279
I didn't realize because of the hunting clothes.

444
00:52:12,360 --> 00:52:15,239
But you are so beautiful. Praise be.

445
00:52:16,120 --> 00:52:18,399
Thanks.

446
00:52:20,000 --> 00:52:24,439
"Your fate should be beautiful
first", my mother used to say.

447
00:52:28,040 --> 00:52:33,399
Malhun Hatun, I couldn't save my father and tribe.

448
00:52:34,400 --> 00:52:37,679
I can do nothing.

449
00:52:38,120 --> 00:52:42,719
Obviously, Osman Bey isn't on our side either.

450
00:52:42,760 --> 00:52:45,119
You don't know Osman Bey, dear.

451
00:52:45,200 --> 00:52:48,639
Osman Bey never lets anybody down.

452
00:52:48,760 --> 00:52:52,039
He'll save your father,
sister-in-law and other people.

453
00:52:52,120 --> 00:52:55,079
Don't be worrying.

454
00:52:58,560 --> 00:53:01,879
I don't know if you understand me, Malhun Hatun.

455
00:53:02,320 --> 00:53:05,559
But I learned that I should trust nobody.

456
00:53:07,200 --> 00:53:11,039
I have nobody but my father who I can count on.

457
00:53:12,680 --> 00:53:15,919
I was like you when I came to these frontiers.

458
00:53:16,320 --> 00:53:20,839
I didn't care about anything
else but my father and tribe,

459
00:53:21,240 --> 00:53:24,439
...which means I understand you well.

460
00:53:26,080 --> 00:53:32,239
I know why you dress like this and
that you feel that you have to stay strong.

461
00:53:33,720 --> 00:53:35,919
You're a Bey's daughter.

462
00:53:36,120 --> 00:53:40,279
You are supposed to protect your father's legacy.

463
00:53:42,080 --> 00:53:44,799
But remember this.

464
00:53:44,840 --> 00:53:50,319
You're not alone, dear. We're with you.

465
00:53:52,880 --> 00:53:55,879
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

466
00:54:00,200 --> 00:54:03,359
One side of mine is angry with me.

467
00:54:06,040 --> 00:54:08,679
You didn't believe me.

468
00:54:10,520 --> 00:54:13,119
My other side...

469
00:54:13,120 --> 00:54:17,839
...asks me what I would do if I
were you. It thinks you're right.

470
00:54:28,200 --> 00:54:31,239
I wish this had never happened, Scholar.

471
00:54:44,040 --> 00:54:49,279
Gonca, wait. We need to talk.

472
00:54:55,240 --> 00:55:01,279
My father left us here not to let
Osman feel free in the frontiers.

473
00:55:02,320 --> 00:55:06,519
-Your mind is still...
-I set my mind on my duty, brother.

474
00:55:07,560 --> 00:55:11,719
-You mind your own business.
-Gonca.

475
00:55:14,360 --> 00:55:17,039
I'm responsible for you while father is away.

476
00:55:17,440 --> 00:55:21,119
Don't you meet that dog called Alaaddin.

477
00:55:21,160 --> 00:55:24,239
Nobody appointed you as my watcher!

478
00:55:24,720 --> 00:55:28,039
Both you and I will only perform our duties.

479
00:55:28,040 --> 00:55:32,479
One of my duties is Alaaddin! Don't you meet him!

480
00:55:32,760 --> 00:55:36,399
Otherwise, I will kill you with him.

481
00:55:37,960 --> 00:55:41,479
You will kill, huh?

482
00:55:44,960 --> 00:55:51,279
Fine. Kill then! Come on, do it! Kill me, brother!

483
00:55:51,360 --> 00:55:56,119
-What are you waiting for? Just kill me!
-Stop, Gonca!

484
00:55:56,720 --> 00:56:00,079
What are you doing?

485
00:56:03,720 --> 00:56:06,319
Pull yourself together!

486
00:56:11,680 --> 00:56:14,719
You can't kill someone who is already dead.

487
00:56:15,200 --> 00:56:19,999
I'm dead. Have you forgotten

488
00:56:22,480 --> 00:56:27,559
How could you forget,
brother? Everybody remembers.

489
00:56:28,800 --> 00:56:31,479
How could you forget?

490
00:56:33,440 --> 00:56:36,679
I'm Gonca, daughter of Yakup Bey.

491
00:56:38,640 --> 00:56:40,919
Gonca the Spy! How could you forget?

492
00:56:40,960 --> 00:56:44,759
-Pull yourself together!
Everybody remembers! You forgot?

493
00:56:44,920 --> 00:56:48,639
Pull yourself together,
Gonca! Did you lose your mind?

494
00:56:53,480 --> 00:56:56,919
May I come in, Mehmed Bey?

495
00:56:58,600 --> 00:57:01,479
Come in, Cerkutay.

496
00:57:09,200 --> 00:57:12,319
Tajeddin Noyan is here.

497
00:57:19,600 --> 00:57:23,359
-Why is he here?
-I don’t know.

498
00:57:24,520 --> 00:57:27,599
But we will see, Gonca.

499
00:57:28,400 --> 00:57:33,079
Tajeddin Noyan never comes
for something good. Be cautious.

500
00:57:39,280 --> 00:57:44,319
Let's start.
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate.

501
00:57:46,480 --> 00:57:50,119
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you, my Bey.

502
00:58:08,840 --> 00:58:14,399
Ghazi, are you full? Why are not eating?

503
00:58:17,160 --> 00:58:20,839
Are you thinking about your father?

504
00:58:23,120 --> 00:58:27,839
Osman Bey, I was so happy
to come together with my father.

505
00:58:28,280 --> 00:58:30,719
But we got separated again.

506
00:58:38,360 --> 00:58:42,159
Boy, he's there for a duty.

507
00:58:42,400 --> 00:58:46,599
Don't worry. He'll be back after the duty.

508
00:58:46,920 --> 00:58:51,039
I'll gladly suffer the longing as
long as the homeland is safe.

509
00:58:51,120 --> 00:58:52,599
Well..

510
00:59:01,680 --> 00:59:07,399
Mother, you look so thoughtful. What's the matter?

511
00:59:09,080 --> 00:59:12,519
If you're worried about Tajeddin Noyan,

512
00:59:12,720 --> 00:59:16,119
...we will take care of
this too with Allah's will.

513
00:59:17,720 --> 00:59:21,839
Do you have another problem, Mother Malhun?

514
00:59:30,560 --> 00:59:32,719
My Bey.

515
00:59:33,200 --> 00:59:36,479
I have things to say if you let me.

516
00:59:37,120 --> 00:59:40,199
Of course, you can.

517
00:59:40,800 --> 00:59:45,519
Sons, I've been having a dream for a long time.

518
00:59:45,800 --> 00:59:48,759
What is it, mother?

519
00:59:49,040 --> 00:59:52,319
I was in ihram in my dream.

520
00:59:56,440 --> 00:59:59,919
I was on the way to Hajj.

521
01:00:04,000 --> 01:00:09,439
My sons, I'll go to Hajj.

522
01:00:33,480 --> 01:00:38,399
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

523
01:00:38,560 --> 01:00:43,679
Welcome. You honor our tribe, Tajeddin Noyan.

524
01:00:49,560 --> 01:00:52,559
I've Heard That Yakup Bey Want to Kutayha..

525
01:00:52,680 --> 01:00:58,359
..and left the marketplace to his children.

526
01:01:02,320 --> 01:01:07,399
This marketplace, in the end..

527
01:01:08,360 --> 01:01:13,319
..is llhanids, it is mine.

528
01:01:29,960 --> 01:01:35,399
I want to see how it is myself.

529
01:01:39,600 --> 01:01:44,639
You've heard it correct.
Foal grows while horse rests.

530
01:01:44,800 --> 01:01:48,879
Children grows, father rests.

531
01:01:49,840 --> 01:01:55,719
My father left me and my sister here to grow it.

532
01:02:00,560 --> 01:02:06,079
Is this the only thing that brought
you here uninvited, Tajeddin Noyan

533
01:02:07,280 --> 01:02:12,799
You must be Gonca Hatun.

534
01:02:16,480 --> 01:02:19,359
You are correct.

535
01:02:19,440 --> 01:02:23,639
My only intention to come to
the marketplace is not only this.

536
01:02:25,440 --> 01:02:30,199
If Yakup Bey is not here, his son is here.

537
01:02:32,160 --> 01:02:35,279
I want to talk with him.

538
01:02:38,160 --> 01:02:40,799
Alone.

539
01:02:44,040 --> 01:02:46,639
Everyone leave.

540
01:02:57,920 --> 01:03:01,079
You too, Gonca.

541
01:03:18,000 --> 01:03:21,799
We are finally alone, Mehmed Bey.

542
01:03:23,640 --> 01:03:26,879
The nephew of Grand Olcaytu.

543
01:03:27,240 --> 01:03:32,559
-What does he want to talk with me?
-About your nemesis.

544
01:03:36,240 --> 01:03:39,599
We will talk about Osman.

545
01:03:44,320 --> 01:03:48,959
Mother, when will you
depart with Allah's permission?

546
01:03:49,240 --> 01:03:53,559
Tomorrow morning, if Allah allows it, son.

547
01:03:58,560 --> 01:04:01,439
Mother.

548
01:04:03,400 --> 01:04:06,479
Why so quickly?

549
01:04:06,600 --> 01:04:11,999
Let me come with you.
I can not do without you.

550
01:04:13,360 --> 01:04:15,839
Let me come with you.

551
01:04:16,920 --> 01:04:21,399
My dear daughter, you can not go anywhere.

552
01:04:21,640 --> 01:04:26,839
You will stay here.
You will go where I go.

553
01:04:32,840 --> 01:04:35,879
May Allah grant you safe travels, mother Malhun.

554
01:04:36,320 --> 01:04:39,159
Give our regards to those blessed lands.

555
01:04:39,240 --> 01:04:42,639
If Allah permits, my son.

556
01:04:44,400 --> 01:04:48,879
I did not want to leave you
in these hard times, however..

557
01:04:49,000 --> 01:04:52,719
.after seeing the same dream over and over.

558
01:04:53,960 --> 01:04:59,719
Do not worry, Malhun.
We will look after this place.

559
01:05:01,800 --> 01:05:06,119
Do not worry, mother. We are here.

560
01:05:06,200 --> 01:05:12,919
Of course.
However, I still worry.

561
01:05:13,400 --> 01:05:16,599
I thought about staying, however..

562
01:05:16,680 --> 01:05:19,359
..the road awaits me.

563
01:05:24,080 --> 01:05:26,879
Do not worry.

564
01:05:26,960 --> 01:05:30,959
You will be beside us with prayers.

565
01:05:37,880 --> 01:05:43,759
Safe travels, Malhun Hatun.
Since you have a long road ahead..

566
01:05:43,840 --> 01:05:47,759
..you need a healer too, right?

567
01:05:49,440 --> 01:05:53,399
Take Shahzade Alaeddin with you

568
01:06:01,080 --> 01:06:05,999
Look here, do you want this
for Malhun Hatun or yourself?

569
01:06:06,080 --> 01:06:08,999
Why would I want this for myself?

570
01:06:09,600 --> 01:06:13,279
I want it for Malhun Hatun.

571
01:06:13,920 --> 01:06:17,999
Also, a Shahzade would be good.

572
01:06:19,320 --> 01:06:24,559
Right, my Bey? Shall he go?
-No.

573
01:06:24,840 --> 01:06:28,999
Alaeddin has his own duty. He can not go anywhere.

574
01:06:31,440 --> 01:06:34,199
However, you can.

575
01:06:34,640 --> 01:06:39,439
No, I have a duty as well.

576
01:06:39,560 --> 01:06:43,719
You already know. With your permission, my Bey.

577
01:06:46,840 --> 01:06:50,799
Look at this one.

578
01:06:56,840 --> 01:07:02,119
Mother. I will miss you so much.

579
01:07:02,360 --> 01:07:07,999
My angel daughter. I will miss you too.

580
01:07:12,120 --> 01:07:16,039
I will miss all of you.

581
01:07:31,000 --> 01:07:36,999
It seems they won't do anything.
I will see to my own business.

582
01:07:42,680 --> 01:07:47,519
I brought something to eat,
Elcim Hatun. Please enjoy.

583
01:07:47,640 --> 01:07:52,679
Thank you. Put it there please.

584
01:07:53,400 --> 01:07:58,679
Where are you going with your sword
in the middle of the night Elcim Hatun?

585
01:08:05,160 --> 01:08:09,039
I had to do this.

586
01:08:28,200 --> 01:08:29,158
Ahjger is the realest emotion
in’this world Mehmed Bey.

587
01:08:29,160 --> 01:08:35,399
Anger is the realest emotion
in this-world Mehmed Bey.

588
01:08:35,520 --> 01:08:38,078
Do you know why?

589
01:08:38,200 --> 01:08:42,839
Because it can not be faked, like love.

590
01:08:42,960 --> 01:08:47,599
However, not like respect.

591
01:08:48,359 --> 01:08:51,399
The moment I mention Osman..

592
01:08:51,479 --> 01:08:55,319
..I hear you grinding your teeth.

593
01:08:57,040 --> 01:08:59,879
Say what you must, Tajeddin Noyan.

594
01:09:00,200 --> 01:09:02,439
That is the real courage.

595
01:09:02,560 --> 01:09:06,519
Talking, by preventing fear.

596
01:09:07,560 --> 01:09:13,559
You are a valiant man,
Mehmed Bey. So is your father.

597
01:09:15,040 --> 01:09:18,799
That is why you could not face Osman.

598
01:09:18,960 --> 01:09:22,999
Because, he is no valiant.

599
01:09:25,439 --> 01:09:28,799
Continue, Tajeddin Noyan

600
01:09:31,240 --> 01:09:36,719
Yakup Bey, did not break
the hand he could not bend.

601
01:09:36,840 --> 01:09:41,319
In the end, he had to shake it.

602
01:09:41,600 --> 01:09:44,037
Because Osman..

603
01:09:44,120 --> 01:09:49,198
..abused your father's good intention.

604
01:09:49,399 --> 01:09:52,359
He misused it.

605
01:09:54,040 --> 01:09:58,719
May Allah protect us from the likes of him.

606
01:10:01,800 --> 01:10:05,119
You are different from your father.

607
01:10:05,240 --> 01:10:09,519
You can break that hand.

608
01:10:10,760 --> 01:10:17,399
Osman drags people to
disaster in disguise of dream.

609
01:10:18,280 --> 01:10:22,159
Now he is preparing to face you.

610
01:10:25,000 --> 01:10:29,639
On top of that, he made fool
of us around all these people.

611
01:10:30,520 --> 01:10:35,679
I am not like my father. I will break that hand.

612
01:10:36,200 --> 01:10:40,119
That is swell. We will soon..

613
01:10:40,240 --> 01:10:44,799
..go on an expedition full of treasure and fame.

614
01:10:45,000 --> 01:10:50,759
You will give me alps for this expedition.

615
01:10:52,640 --> 01:10:56,799
My father won't allow this, Tajeddin Noyan.

616
01:10:56,880 --> 01:10:59,999
At that very point..

617
01:11:00,080 --> 01:11:05,359
..one must become a coward again, Mehmed.

618
01:11:05,840 --> 01:11:09,119
One needs to remember.

619
01:11:09,200 --> 01:11:13,399
One needs to remember why..

620
01:11:13,480 --> 01:11:18,719
..their father left their
home and ran off to Kutahya.

621
01:11:18,840 --> 01:11:25,399
One needs to realise who they're going against.

622
01:11:27,200 --> 01:11:30,679
we haven't disagreed yet, Tajeddin Noyan.

623
01:11:30,840 --> 01:11:35,119
That is your duty. Convince your father.

624
01:11:35,240 --> 01:11:38,839
And I will back you up..

625
01:11:38,960 --> 01:11:43,319
..on your fight against Osman.

626
01:11:43,520 --> 01:11:47,799
On top of that, I can break that hand for you.

627
01:11:47,920 --> 01:11:51,559
We are okay to the hand that needs breaking.

628
01:11:51,880 --> 01:11:57,399
However, I have a question for you as well.

629
01:11:57,480 --> 01:12:01,279
You will give me one answer.

630
01:12:01,600 --> 01:12:04,279
Did you shoot that arrow..

631
01:12:04,480 --> 01:12:08,239
..to my father?

632
01:12:11,440 --> 01:12:14,479
Look,son.

633
01:12:15,360 --> 01:12:19,279
This is my heraldry ring.

634
01:12:20,280 --> 01:12:23,919
The moment I send this ring to Tabriz..

635
01:12:24,120 --> 01:12:28,719
Every noker of llhanids come to my aid.

636
01:12:28,800 --> 01:12:33,479
A hundred thousand, even two
hundred thousand, however...

637
01:12:33,560 --> 01:12:37,719
..why would I just go..

638
01:12:37,800 --> 01:12:41,919
.and plan assassination to the Bey of Kutahya?

639
01:12:43,920 --> 01:12:47,679
Do not make me laught, Mehmed.

640
01:12:47,760 --> 01:12:51,039
I asked a question and got my answer.

641
01:13:01,400 --> 01:13:06,039
We will do great things with you, Mehmet.

642
01:13:06,120 --> 01:13:08,679
Great things.

643
01:13:45,920 --> 01:13:48,559
Elcim Hatun is running away, catch her!

644
01:13:48,680 --> 01:13:51,679
She won't stay calm. Alp

645
01:13:51,800 --> 01:13:54,799
Close the exits. Come on.

646
01:13:59,160 --> 01:14:02,399
Hatun, stop

647
01:14:03,040 --> 01:14:06,759
You are trying for no reason... For no reason.

648
01:14:21,440 --> 01:14:25,959
What happened, Hatun? Where are you going, huh?

649
01:14:26,400 --> 01:14:29,079
I am telling you to stop. Don't you hear me?
-Orhan Bey!

650
01:14:29,280 --> 01:14:31,679
Tell me.
-Move!

651
01:14:31,760 --> 01:14:34,759
-I will go and take my father.
-Give me patience, Allah!

652
01:14:35,840 --> 01:14:38,439
Elcim Hatun.

653
01:14:38,680 --> 01:14:44,039
I told you that you cannot go
anywhere. Go to your room now.

654
01:14:44,160 --> 01:14:48,239
I can break all the walls if
necessary, and I will go there!

655
01:14:48,480 --> 01:14:53,319
It's obvious... It's obvious..

656
01:14:54,600 --> 01:14:57,799
You know how to break things.

657
01:14:57,880 --> 01:15:02,079
You left me no other choice, Orhan Bey
-Sisters!

658
01:15:02,520 --> 01:15:05,639
Take Elcim Hatun to her room.

659
01:15:05,760 --> 01:15:07,879
Apparently, she lost her way.

660
01:15:08,000 --> 01:15:13,279
Don't touch me! Let me go!
You cannot control me in a room!

661
01:15:14,800 --> 01:15:16,159
Let me go!

662
01:15:32,760 --> 01:15:36,879
Did the Lords who disgraced Byzantium arrive?

663
01:15:37,120 --> 01:15:42,279
They did. They are talking about
the tax they will pay to Osman.

664
01:15:43,640 --> 01:15:49,079
Weak men... Do we need enemies
when we have those weak men?

665
01:15:49,600 --> 01:15:53,119
These dogs are carrying water
with a bucket to the mad river.

666
01:15:54,240 --> 01:15:57,319
I will dry them up first...

667
01:15:57,440 --> 01:16:01,199
...then that river.

668
01:16:08,320 --> 01:16:11,679
Malhun... I know that you really want to go...

669
01:16:11,800 --> 01:16:15,119
...but you won’t go to Hajj for now.

670
01:16:15,240 --> 01:16:18,679
But everyone will think that
you are on the way to Hajj.

671
01:16:18,840 --> 01:16:23,159
You will go to Turkmen Beys.

672
01:16:23,320 --> 01:16:26,359
You will tell them to support me.

673
01:16:26,440 --> 01:16:31,279
You will flare up the dying flame of Gaza.

674
01:16:31,720 --> 01:16:34,959
When they see the mother
of the state before them...

675
01:16:35,120 --> 01:16:37,599
...they will understand how serious it is.

676
01:16:37,760 --> 01:16:42,439
As you say, my Bey... But
why am I going there secretly?

677
01:16:42,520 --> 01:16:45,679
The army of great gaza
will be established secretly.

678
01:16:45,800 --> 01:16:49,039
You won't put yourself in danger either.

679
01:16:49,320 --> 01:16:51,599
Can I come in, my Bey?

680
01:16:52,000 --> 01:16:54,799
Come in.

681
01:16:56,760 --> 01:17:00,239
All preparations have been
completed to set out, my Bey.

682
01:17:00,440 --> 01:17:03,239
Konur will come with you.

683
01:17:03,480 --> 01:17:08,599
Konur. Malhun Hatun is entrusted directly to you.

684
01:17:08,800 --> 01:17:12,559
You will visit all the Beys and tribes.

685
01:17:12,680 --> 01:17:17,479
I will protect your entrustment with my life,
my Bey. Whoever’s heart beats with us...

686
01:17:17,520 --> 01:17:20,359
...will stand by the protector
of the Turks, my Bey.

687
01:17:20,360 --> 01:17:24,239
When you fulfill your duty
properly, neither Tajeddin Noyan...

688
01:17:24,240 --> 01:17:27,759
...nor the executioner of the Romans
will be able to stand against us.

689
01:17:27,760 --> 01:17:30,879
The path is clear, and those
who walk on it are known, my Bey.

690
01:17:30,960 --> 01:17:33,479
The duty of the Hajj can wait for now.

691
01:17:33,560 --> 01:17:37,519
First, I will fulfill my duty for the
glarification of the word of Allah.

692
01:17:37,600 --> 01:17:41,759
Thank you.
We cannot be strong without a union.

693
01:17:41,840 --> 01:17:44,799
We will first get strong..

694
01:17:44,880 --> 01:17:49,319
...then we will be a state
which will rule the whole world.

695
01:17:49,800 --> 01:17:52,279
May our gaza be blessed.

696
01:17:52,400 --> 01:17:55,559
-If Allah permits my Bey.
-If Allah permits my Bey.

697
01:17:55,640 --> 01:17:58,719
If Allah permits, if Allah permits.

698
01:17:59,560 --> 01:18:04,239
Collecting the taxes to be sent
to Osman has become difficult.

699
01:18:04,320 --> 01:18:08,479
In the end, he seized the goods of the
merchants and people, causing unrest.

700
01:18:08,560 --> 01:18:11,879
They are now unable to pay the taxes.

701
01:18:12,040 --> 01:18:15,359
Then don't pay the taxes.
-How?

702
01:18:15,520 --> 01:18:17,399
With which power, Olivia?

703
01:18:17,480 --> 01:18:21,399
This gold prevents Osman from
reaching the walls of our castle, Olivia.

704
01:18:21,480 --> 01:18:27,519
Cowards... Do you think this gold can stop Osman?

705
01:18:28,440 --> 01:18:31,879
You only made him stronger.

706
01:18:55,120 --> 01:18:58,759
Imren Tegin. The executioner of Roman Empire.

707
01:19:02,240 --> 01:19:05,199
And you must be the sheep of Byzantium.

708
01:19:05,200 --> 01:19:09,319
You have endured well with
these cowards until now, Olivia.

709
01:19:12,120 --> 01:19:15,959
How can you come in like
this and talk to nobles this way?

710
01:19:15,960 --> 01:19:20,719
What nobility? Aren't you the
Lords who surrendered to Osman?

711
01:19:20,880 --> 01:19:24,399
If the Emperor supported us,
we wouldn't be obliged to this.

712
01:19:24,520 --> 01:19:28,519
He cannot leave us alone
question us at the same time.

713
01:19:29,040 --> 01:19:31,759
Is the Emperor in such a
helpless state to send you?

714
01:19:31,760 --> 01:19:34,439
How much gold did you give Osman?

715
01:19:35,760 --> 01:19:38,719
How much gold did you give Osman?

716
01:19:38,800 --> 01:19:44,439
Who are you? I am not
going to answer to a Turcopole!

717
01:19:46,440 --> 01:19:51,879
I would rather die.
-Is that so?

718
01:20:00,360 --> 01:20:03,559
Your prayers are accepted

719
01:20:23,240 --> 01:20:26,919
Are you with me, Olivia?

720
01:20:28,200 --> 01:20:31,679
I am with whoever brings Osman's end.

721
01:20:31,760 --> 01:20:35,959
Good. You are a smart woman.

722
01:20:57,760 --> 01:21:01,679
You will manage the castles of
the deceased lords on my behalf.

723
01:21:01,760 --> 01:21:04,119
Osman won't know anything.

724
01:21:04,200 --> 01:21:07,279
Things will remain as they are.

725
01:21:07,360 --> 01:21:10,439
With the order of the Emperor.

726
01:21:22,600 --> 01:21:26,319
Do you know why I accepted this duty, Olivia?

727
01:21:27,240 --> 01:21:29,679
Since you killed the Lords..

728
01:21:29,760 --> 01:21:33,239
...since you took their castles
with the order of the Emperor...

729
01:21:33,440 --> 01:21:36,879
...you want to be the only ruler here.

730
01:21:37,360 --> 01:21:42,559
You are a smart woman.
You are a smart woman.

731
01:21:44,480 --> 01:21:46,639
Will you be able to do this alone?

732
01:21:46,640 --> 01:21:50,279
You cannot even imagine what I can do alone.

733
01:21:50,800 --> 01:21:55,479
But no one can imagine
what I can do when I have the..

734
01:21:55,480 --> 01:21:59,279
...support of Tajeddin Noyan and his nokers.

735
01:22:17,280 --> 01:22:20,039
Let me go

736
01:22:22,080 --> 01:22:25,199
My Shahzade, I...
-Forgive us, Kismet Hatun.

737
01:22:25,360 --> 01:22:28,559
Sisters... Take care of her.

738
01:22:31,360 --> 01:22:35,187
Let me go, Orhan Bey! I
will go and save my father!

739
01:22:35,199 --> 01:22:36,479
Elcim Hatuni

740
01:22:37,200 --> 01:22:39,959
Don't you hear us?

741
01:22:40,040 --> 01:22:43,199
No... I understood you.

742
01:22:43,320 --> 01:22:47,239
You cannot help me. Get out of my way!
-What are you?

743
01:22:47,400 --> 01:22:50,279
You seem smart one day,
you seem stupid the other day!

744
01:22:50,400 --> 01:22:52,079
Who are you to call me stupid?

745
01:22:52,160 --> 01:22:55,079
Isn't what you're doing stupidity?

746
01:22:57,560 --> 01:23:03,199
Elcim Hatun...
Tajeddin is serious.

747
01:23:03,280 --> 01:23:06,559
With the slightest mistake you make...

748
01:23:06,840 --> 01:23:11,119
...he will behead your father and your aunt.

749
01:23:11,280 --> 01:23:15,479
My family is dying anyway,
Orhan Bey! Your father...

750
01:23:15,720 --> 01:23:19,999
...is going to make an agreement with that
dog, who killed my mother and my brother!

751
01:23:20,800 --> 01:23:23,639
Hatun... You don’t know my father and..

752
01:23:23,920 --> 01:23:28,439
...my family, Hatun.
You don't know us.

753
01:23:28,520 --> 01:23:33,319
Yes. I don't know you or your father.

754
01:23:33,440 --> 01:23:36,439
But I know Tajeddin Noyan very well.

755
01:23:36,640 --> 01:23:42,279
If I don't make a move now, I
will lose my father and my aunt.

756
01:23:42,520 --> 01:23:47,599
Understood... You won't pull yourself together.

757
01:23:49,200 --> 01:23:52,319
Orhan Bey! What are you doing?

758
01:23:52,440 --> 01:23:56,879
Orhan Bey, what are you
doing? Orhan Bey, open the door!

759
01:23:57,080 --> 01:23:59,479
Orhan Bey

760
01:23:59,560 --> 01:24:03,519
You left me no other choice,
Hatun. Have a good rest.

761
01:24:03,680 --> 01:24:06,479
Orhan Beyl Open the door! Orhan Bey!

762
01:24:06,680 --> 01:24:09,719
Have a good rest, so you
can pull yourself together. Alps.

763
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:14,519
This door will remain locked. The
Hatun inside will never come out.

764
01:24:14,760 --> 01:24:16,639
Come on. I will make you pay for this Orhan Bey!

765
01:24:16,640 --> 01:24:17,479
Come on.
-I will make you pay for this, Orhan Bey!

766
01:24:17,560 --> 01:24:20,239
I will make you pay for this!

767
01:24:20,480 --> 01:24:23,239
He says he will put a leash on a Turk...

768
01:24:23,360 --> 01:24:28,759
...especially a stubborn Gokboru like Osman.

769
01:24:29,000 --> 01:24:32,119
He will use him as a pawn in his own war.

770
01:24:32,240 --> 01:24:36,959
They'll do politics. Stupid man.

771
01:24:38,840 --> 01:24:42,439
If he's a stupid man, I'm the executioner.

772
01:24:42,520 --> 01:24:45,199
Why did we come here?

773
01:24:45,320 --> 01:24:49,719
For blood!
For blood!

774
01:24:49,720 --> 01:24:51,319
What are we going to die for?

775
01:24:51,400 --> 01:24:55,559
For lands! For a war!
For lands! For a war!

776
01:24:55,640 --> 01:24:59,239
When war is necessary at a
place, doing politics means nothing.

777
01:24:59,680 --> 01:25:02,759
Strong ones win in a war.

778
01:25:03,040 --> 01:25:08,039
We will start this war and end it the way we want.

779
01:25:08,120 --> 01:25:14,679
I set the rules of the game,
and if necessary, I break them.

780
01:25:15,840 --> 01:25:20,119
Tajeddin Noyan might think
he is allies with Byzantium.

781
01:25:20,200 --> 01:25:24,559
-What will be our move, Imren Tegin?
-We will attack Osman...

782
01:25:24,800 --> 01:25:28,759
...from his weakest spot,
his family, his beloved ones.

783
01:25:29,920 --> 01:25:33,839
e will bring him close to us step by step.

784
01:25:34,080 --> 01:25:37,359
You will bring me the head of Alaeddin.

785
01:25:37,440 --> 01:25:42,279
I will make him experience the
worst pain. I will take his son from him.

786
01:25:42,440 --> 01:25:45,879
-I will send my most talented man.
-No.

787
01:25:48,200 --> 01:25:51,479
Alaca will handle this.

788
01:25:51,560 --> 01:25:57,039
Alaca. Sneak in the city.
Fulfill your duty quickly.

789
01:25:59,680 --> 01:26:03,679
These lands and these castles belong to us now!

790
01:26:03,800 --> 01:26:07,919
We don't take orders from anyone,
we don't pledge allegiance to anyone.

791
01:26:08,120 --> 01:26:12,679
We start the games and wars, and we end them.

792
01:26:12,760 --> 01:26:15,439
Let the swords be unsheathed now.

793
01:26:15,600 --> 01:26:18,056
Even if we water these
lands with our blood, we

794
01:26:18,068 --> 01:26:20,639
will not put our swords
back into their sheaths...

795
01:26:20,640 --> 01:26:22,239
..until we make Osman kneel!

796
01:26:22,280 --> 01:26:30,399
Long live Imren Tegin!
Long live Imren Tegin!

797
01:26:37,040 --> 01:26:39,919
Malhun mother...

798
01:26:41,440 --> 01:26:45,199
May Allah let you go there safely, I hope.

799
01:26:46,440 --> 01:26:52,959
My valiant son... My Alaeddin... Thank you.

800
01:26:54,640 --> 01:26:58,519
May Allah be with you.
-You too, mother, you too.

801
01:27:10,840 --> 01:27:14,759
Mother...
-My Orhan...

802
01:27:22,440 --> 01:27:25,519
My lion son..

803
01:27:30,880 --> 01:27:33,839
You and your siblings are entrusted to each other.

804
01:27:33,840 --> 01:27:37,879
You will always stay united, alright?

805
01:27:39,120 --> 01:27:42,079
Your mother is always here.

806
01:27:42,160 --> 01:27:44,839
Don't forget.

807
01:27:44,920 --> 01:27:48,599
My mother... Don't worry about us, alright?

808
01:27:48,680 --> 01:27:53,039
Nothing will change here until you come back.

809
01:27:54,000 --> 01:27:57,199
We will always stay united.

810
01:27:57,920 --> 01:28:00,599
May Allah be with you.

811
01:28:00,720 --> 01:28:05,239
You top, my mother... You too.

812
01:28:08,560 --> 01:28:14,519
My Fatma... My beautiful eyed, angel daughter...

813
01:28:17,400 --> 01:28:19,159
Don't be sad...

814
01:28:20,400 --> 01:28:23,039
I will go to Beytullah with Allah's consent.

815
01:28:23,040 --> 01:28:25,999
I will put my face on the
sacred lands and come back.

816
01:28:26,000 --> 01:28:28,879
We will not be away from each other forever.

817
01:28:30,840 --> 01:28:35,879
I know... I know, my mother...
May you go there safely.

818
01:28:36,200 --> 01:28:40,239
May you go quickly and come back quickly.

819
01:28:41,040 --> 01:28:45,999
Amen, beauty. Amen.

820
01:28:46,000 --> 01:28:50,239
Keep your eyes on your brothers.

821
01:28:53,320 --> 01:28:56,759
And don't you disobey Mother Bala.

822
01:29:01,840 --> 01:29:06,159
My strong daughter. May Allah protect you.

823
01:29:10,800 --> 01:29:14,079
Malhun Hatun, have a safe journey.

824
01:29:14,240 --> 01:29:18,159
Give me your pardon in this world
and Qiyamah if I ever offended you.

825
01:29:18,160 --> 01:29:21,759
You have my pardon, Ulgen. You pardon me too.

826
01:29:21,840 --> 01:29:24,359
You have my pardon.

827
01:29:26,120 --> 01:29:29,799
Alps, give me your pardon
in this world and Qiyamah.

828
01:29:29,840 --> 01:29:32,399
You have my pardon

829
01:29:32,480 --> 01:29:36,319
You have my pardon too, but what
will you bring for me from Mecca?

830
01:29:36,600 --> 01:29:40,119
Whatever you want, Ghazi Alp.

831
01:29:40,320 --> 01:29:44,319
You’re going to stone the
devil. I want one of those stones.

832
01:29:44,480 --> 01:29:48,079
A stone can repel the devil may
do even more to the heathens!

833
01:29:48,320 --> 01:29:51,439
Alright, I will bring some.

834
01:29:51,800 --> 01:29:55,639
Ghazi, those stones aren't anything like that.

835
01:29:55,760 --> 01:29:58,439
But if you want, we can make a sword for you.

836
01:29:58,440 --> 01:30:01,439
-You can fight the heathens with it.
-That will do, my Bey!

837
01:30:01,480 --> 01:30:05,159
That's my boy. Konur.

838
01:30:08,280 --> 01:30:11,439
-Is everything set?
-Everything is set, my Bey.

839
01:30:11,440 --> 01:30:14,599
Alps to escort us are waiting
for us outside Yenisehir.

840
01:30:15,040 --> 01:30:17,839
Let's go then.

841
01:31:09,160 --> 01:31:12,159
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

842
01:31:13,640 --> 01:31:16,519
Do you know why Tajeddin
Noyan is here, Cerkutay Bey?

843
01:31:16,640 --> 01:31:21,279
I don't know, Gonca Hatun. But he wouldn't
be here if he didn't seek something big.

844
01:31:21,560 --> 01:31:25,559
Right. Right.

845
01:31:55,840 --> 01:32:00,999
Gonca Hatun, are you waiting to see me off?

846
01:32:02,680 --> 01:32:06,319
I wouldn't have kept you waiting if I had known?

847
01:32:09,640 --> 01:32:13,799
No. You misjudged.

848
01:32:14,080 --> 01:32:19,559
We have no traditions like seeing the
uninvited guests off, Tajeddin Noyan.

849
01:32:21,400 --> 01:32:25,479
They can go just like they come.

850
01:32:26,040 --> 01:32:31,039
Gonca Hatun, I can see that my being here...

851
01:32:31,080 --> 01:32:34,279
...bothered you.

852
01:32:34,760 --> 01:32:38,119
Your face looking like a rosebud...

853
01:32:38,760 --> 01:32:42,079
...is spreading anger for me.

854
01:32:45,160 --> 01:32:48,199
The poison in your heart is obvious in your face!

855
01:32:48,360 --> 01:32:51,119
You can't hide it with your words.

856
01:33:06,320 --> 01:33:10,999
I had a thing to do. But I caught you
here before you left, Tajeddin Noyan.

857
01:33:11,880 --> 01:33:15,719
I like people who put the
duty above anything else.

858
01:33:15,800 --> 01:33:19,159
I was so pleased with my time here.

859
01:33:19,360 --> 01:33:23,079
I will come again soon.

860
01:33:24,840 --> 01:33:26,719
But...

861
01:33:29,880 --> 01:33:33,319
If you collaborate with Osman,

862
01:33:33,400 --> 01:33:36,879
...I won't be your guest next time...

863
01:33:36,960 --> 01:33:39,919
..but your death.

864
01:33:42,680 --> 01:33:46,679
Well... Stay safe.

865
01:33:54,240 --> 01:33:57,399
Stay safe.

866
01:34:02,680 --> 01:34:08,239
Whoever denies his origin has no place among us.

867
01:34:09,840 --> 01:34:13,719
Ashm beni inkar etti ise ne gelir elden?

868
01:34:13,720 --> 01:34:17,559
..if my origin has denied me?

869
01:34:23,720 --> 01:34:27,119
Mighty Amir.

870
01:34:29,280 --> 01:34:32,239
Osman's wife is going to Hajj.

871
01:34:32,560 --> 01:34:36,199
And Osman is on the way to see her off.

872
01:34:41,120 --> 01:34:44,759
Bring that woman to me.

873
01:34:46,880 --> 01:34:51,599
I can't pay a visit with empty hands.

874
01:36:24,800 --> 01:36:29,399
Osman's wife. Let's catch her

875
01:36:38,440 --> 01:36:41,839
-They're coming, my Bey.
-Alps.

876
01:36:41,920 --> 01:36:45,159
Our target will be Gunduz Bey and Ayca Hatun.

877
01:36:45,440 --> 01:36:48,079
Let's show them Turks cannot be imprisoned!

878
01:36:48,120 --> 01:36:53,199
-As you order, my Bey!
-Let’s go! Giddap!

879
01:37:29,520 --> 01:37:33,119
Come on!

880
01:37:38,040 --> 01:37:40,679
Osman Bey!

881
01:37:57,200 --> 01:38:00,879
Come on!

882
01:39:17,960 --> 01:39:20,679
Are you alright?

883
01:39:21,200 --> 01:39:25,439
We are alright, thanks to you.

884
01:39:29,960 --> 01:39:36,079
How did you find us in this
middle of nowhere, Osman Bey?

885
01:39:38,040 --> 01:39:45,079
Osman put even his life in danger to rescue you.

886
01:39:47,680 --> 01:39:53,439
Now, he will squirm to learn where you are.

887
01:39:53,840 --> 01:39:57,959
I will make him my dog thanks to you.

888
01:39:58,520 --> 01:40:03,199
No one will learn where these two will be!

889
01:40:04,840 --> 01:40:07,879
Take them!

890
01:40:15,200 --> 01:40:19,999
This Tajeddin.. First he drove a
wedge between me and my son..

891
01:40:20,280 --> 01:40:24,479
..then he did the same with
Hatun. He drove a wedge between..

892
01:40:24,760 --> 01:40:29,959
..Ayca Hatun and my son. He
played mind games to my son.

893
01:40:31,400 --> 01:40:35,519
Then, he started carving us out from the inside.

894
01:40:35,640 --> 01:40:40,479
He said "Gather all Beys to the same council."

895
01:40:40,600 --> 01:40:46,039
His intention is to gather alps from them as well.

896
01:40:46,040 --> 01:40:50,519
However, you can not put leash..

897
01:40:50,640 --> 01:40:53,559
..on a Turk's neck.

898
01:40:53,560 --> 01:40:55,839
Then, they attacked our tribe.

899
01:40:55,960 --> 01:40:58,999
He put my mother and my Bey in a tent.

900
01:40:59,200 --> 01:41:02,319
They burned it down, Osman Bey.

901
01:41:02,400 --> 01:41:05,599
Some ran away, some fell.

902
01:41:06,240 --> 01:41:12,479
They started destroying us
one way or another, Osman Bey.

903
01:41:12,840 --> 01:41:16,319
They do not do an expedition..

904
01:41:16,320 --> 01:41:21,159
..this is an expedition to destroy us.

905
01:41:22,760 --> 01:41:26,599
Do not worry. I understand you well.

906
01:41:26,800 --> 01:41:29,559
I understand you the most.

907
01:41:30,400 --> 01:41:33,119
However..

908
01:41:34,320 --> 01:41:38,919
..we have two roads ahead of us. Tell me..

909
01:41:39,240 --> 01:41:43,159
..do you want to be free..

910
01:41:43,760 --> 01:41:48,159
..or want to be safe?

911
01:41:51,440 --> 01:41:56,959
We already picked our road, Osman Bey.

912
01:41:58,440 --> 01:42:02,999
Our road is your road.

913
01:42:03,080 --> 01:42:07,599
Thank you. We are still free, thank Allah.

914
01:42:07,720 --> 01:42:10,159
We are still free.

915
01:42:10,320 --> 01:42:13,439
However, know this..

916
01:42:13,680 --> 01:42:17,319
We have a great war ahead of us.

917
01:42:17,400 --> 01:42:22,159
They are well prepared.
Now, Olcaytu wants to begin.

918
01:42:22,520 --> 01:42:25,399
However..

919
01:42:26,600 --> 01:42:29,199
..if we can slow him down..

920
01:42:29,320 --> 01:42:33,999
The harder we resist..

921
01:42:34,160 --> 01:42:36,759
..the more Tajeddin Noyan..

922
01:42:36,960 --> 01:42:40,719
..will be in a tight spot.

923
01:42:41,440 --> 01:42:44,239
Not only he will fall in a tight spot..

924
01:42:44,320 --> 01:42:47,919
..maybe he will lose his status as well.

925
01:42:48,680 --> 01:42:51,759
I know, your tribe is broken.

926
01:42:51,960 --> 01:42:55,239
However, if there is still a hope..

927
01:42:55,960 --> 01:42:58,919
..it is because of you.

928
01:42:59,400 --> 01:43:03,239
Thank you, Osman Bey.

929
01:43:03,320 --> 01:43:08,519
Even hearing this, cools my heart off.

930
01:43:08,600 --> 01:43:10,999
Thank you.

931
01:43:11,400 --> 01:43:16,639
Now, they want to scatter us.
However, now two Kayi unites.

932
01:43:16,760 --> 01:43:19,399
They will not succeed.

933
01:43:19,640 --> 01:43:23,719
-What will we do?
-The same thing we always do!

934
01:43:24,200 --> 01:43:29,519
We will move towards them!
The only victor is Allah!

935
01:43:30,600 --> 01:43:34,959
Allah is the greatest!

936
01:44:12,920 --> 01:44:15,759
I heard your fiance is captive in Konya.

937
01:44:15,760 --> 01:44:18,679
I will save your fiance and
make you two come together.

938
01:44:18,720 --> 01:44:21,519
You will caught by Tajeddin Noyan...

939
01:44:21,640 --> 01:44:24,439
...and be our spy.

940
01:44:24,520 --> 01:44:28,679
I'm ready to do anything, Osman Bey.

941
01:44:28,800 --> 01:44:31,599
Move.

942
01:44:34,400 --> 01:44:37,999
Now what my Beys wants has happened.

943
01:44:38,280 --> 01:44:43,159
Tajeddin... Noker!

944
01:44:46,520 --> 01:44:51,719
I want to see your face
when you realize the truth.

945
01:45:03,720 --> 01:45:06,999
Finally.

946
01:45:13,880 --> 01:45:16,079
Ayca.

947
01:45:18,920 --> 01:45:21,839
Sister-in-law.

948
01:45:24,720 --> 01:45:28,199
Thanks to Allah, you're fine.

949
01:45:33,520 --> 01:45:37,599
Don't, Ayca. The danger isn’t over yet.

950
01:45:37,720 --> 01:45:42,239
Why? We're free now. Will we
keep the truth from Osman Bey?

951
01:45:42,320 --> 01:45:44,639
Father.
-Shh.

952
01:45:44,840 --> 01:45:50,239
She will be sister-in-law for some time, alright?

953
01:45:50,640 --> 01:45:53,279
Nobody will know...

954
01:45:53,280 --> 01:45:55,999
...Ayca and you changed places.

955
01:45:57,840 --> 01:46:01,079
Things will be more complicated..

956
01:46:01,320 --> 01:46:03,639
...if Osman Bey finds out, dear.

957
01:46:03,680 --> 01:46:06,559
They will face the same trouble sooner or later.

958
01:46:06,600 --> 01:46:09,359
We need to tell them.

959
01:46:15,640 --> 01:46:18,639
I'm glad you are together again.

960
01:46:19,880 --> 01:46:22,919
Elcim Hatun mentioned you a lot.

961
01:46:23,120 --> 01:46:25,919
-Welcome again.
-Thank you.

962
01:46:29,800 --> 01:46:31,119
-Gunduz Bey.
-Yes?

963
01:46:31,200 --> 01:46:34,439
-Osman Bey expects you in the council.
-Is that so?

964
01:46:35,240 --> 01:46:38,399
Alright. I should go then, Bala Hatun.

965
01:46:38,640 --> 01:46:40,679
Sure.

966
01:46:41,440 --> 01:46:46,719
Thank you, Bala Hatun. Our family
are back together thanks to you.

967
01:46:49,560 --> 01:46:54,279
Thanks. We will never forget
about this favor for yours, Bala Hatun.

968
01:46:55,000 --> 01:46:57,999
We did our part, dear.

969
01:47:00,720 --> 01:47:03,599
Your captivity is over, Ayca Hatun.

970
01:47:03,760 --> 01:47:07,719
We’ll take care of those dogs
all together. Don't be upset.

971
01:47:08,280 --> 01:47:13,599
None of us can compete with him.
You don't know him, Bala Hatun.

972
01:47:14,080 --> 01:47:17,799
Tajeddin is not like any other enemies.

973
01:47:18,440 --> 01:47:23,519
He takes his strength from his
mind. It's impossible to beat him.

974
01:47:29,280 --> 01:47:32,999
Impossible?

975
01:47:34,240 --> 01:47:37,799
Obviously, he scared you.

976
01:47:37,960 --> 01:47:40,119
This is not fear.

977
01:47:40,360 --> 01:47:43,439
Tajeddin knows well how to play with his prey.

978
01:47:43,680 --> 01:47:48,519
He never plans to kill his
enemy but do more than death.

979
01:47:48,800 --> 01:47:52,039
He turns his enemies into slaves for himself.

980
01:47:57,920 --> 01:48:00,919
TACETTTN NOYAN HEADQUARTERS

981
01:48:01,080 --> 01:48:04,559
-Do I have permission?
-Come in.

982
01:48:12,560 --> 01:48:17,159
Mighty Amir, we got Princess Maria.

983
01:48:17,200 --> 01:48:20,399
They're bringing her to the tent.

984
01:48:21,040 --> 01:48:26,119
Osman, now I got you.

985
01:48:28,520 --> 01:48:31,239
Treat the woman kindly.

986
01:48:31,320 --> 01:48:37,879
I will go see Osman and give him the great news.

987
01:48:39,600 --> 01:48:45,799
Whywould you invite Tajeddin Noyan...

988
01:48:46,160 --> 01:48:49,399
...to the dinner, Osman Bey?

989
01:48:49,680 --> 01:48:53,679
He is the killer...

990
01:48:54,400 --> 01:48:59,679
...of my wife, child and people.

991
01:49:00,160 --> 01:49:03,279
I know, Gunduz Bey. I know that.

992
01:49:03,280 --> 01:49:06,239
You don't know, Osman Bey. You don't.

993
01:49:06,480 --> 01:49:10,519
If you intend to talk to him to make an agreement,

994
01:49:11,080 --> 01:49:13,479
...you don't know.

995
01:49:13,680 --> 01:49:19,599
Behind his naive face, there is a raving animal.

996
01:49:19,680 --> 01:49:23,159
Even a dog hunts to fill its stomach.

997
01:49:23,400 --> 01:49:27,719
But he kills for pleasure.

998
01:49:28,480 --> 01:49:33,439
He chained all my soldiers to each other...

999
01:49:33,760 --> 01:49:37,079
..and threw them into a fire pit.

1000
01:49:38,080 --> 01:49:41,799
He sat on the chair and watched them.

1001
01:49:44,520 --> 01:49:47,999
He also made me watch.

1002
01:49:50,240 --> 01:49:53,399
He's quite a monster, Osman Bey.

1003
01:49:53,480 --> 01:49:55,679
Quite a monster.

1004
01:49:57,960 --> 01:50:00,959
Tajeddin Noyan

1005
01:50:01,920 --> 01:50:04,799
...is like a wild flood.

1006
01:50:05,640 --> 01:50:09,799
If we stand like a deadwood against him,

1007
01:50:10,040 --> 01:50:12,079
...we will vanish away.

1008
01:50:12,120 --> 01:50:18,559
But we will be a plane tree
to stand high after the flood.

1009
01:50:18,720 --> 01:50:23,559
For this reason, we are
making our game accordingly.

1010
01:50:24,280 --> 01:50:27,719
Do you have another intention..

1011
01:50:27,760 --> 01:50:30,639
...with this invitation?

1012
01:50:30,880 --> 01:50:36,839
Those ruling with blood
are to be treated with blood.

1013
01:50:37,320 --> 01:50:41,119
Don't be worrying at all.

1014
01:50:41,280 --> 01:50:46,159
e make all of our moves to destroy Tajeddin Noyan.

1015
01:50:47,760 --> 01:50:50,999
You’ll see when you come to the yard.

1016
01:50:51,600 --> 01:50:54,439
Your heart will be at ease then.

1017
01:50:56,120 --> 01:50:59,879
Tell me. Your people are on the way.

1018
01:51:00,360 --> 01:51:02,159
Where will you settle in?

1019
01:51:02,160 --> 01:51:06,239
Wherever we can be the
farthest away from Mongolians.

1020
01:51:06,880 --> 01:51:11,839
It will take a long time for us to
heal our wounds, Osman Bey.

1021
01:51:12,120 --> 01:51:15,879
-We'll go south.
-Well...

1022
01:51:16,680 --> 01:51:20,559
Will you leave us alone?
-No.

1023
01:51:21,560 --> 01:51:24,519
I will make my people settle in.

1024
01:51:24,720 --> 01:51:29,839
And then I will come back for vengeance.

1025
01:51:34,760 --> 01:51:40,159
I want to host..

1026
01:51:40,760 --> 01:51:45,319
...your people and alps in my lands. Stay here.

1027
01:51:48,040 --> 01:51:52,719
We would be a burden for you, Osman Bey.

1028
01:51:52,840 --> 01:51:57,359
And Tajeddin Noyan's wrath would be on you.

1029
01:51:57,400 --> 01:52:00,599
Maybe that's what I want.

1030
01:52:00,880 --> 01:52:03,359
Maybe I want to...

1031
01:52:03,680 --> 01:52:08,239
...drive him mad with fury, reveal
the animal inside him and choke him.

1032
01:52:09,960 --> 01:52:12,759
You can't leave me alone in such a situation.

1033
01:52:13,000 --> 01:52:17,159
You'll be with us. We will protect Yenisehir.

1034
01:52:17,640 --> 01:52:20,159
And we will see the end together.

1035
01:52:20,320 --> 01:52:23,959
Well... What can I say, Osman Bey?

1036
01:52:24,320 --> 01:52:26,959
The destiny says the last words.

1037
01:52:26,960 --> 01:52:29,999
May Allah help us.

1038
01:52:30,400 --> 01:52:34,279
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

1039
01:52:35,760 --> 01:52:39,159
I will make you feel better.

1040
01:52:40,080 --> 01:52:43,159
You are my only confidant.

1041
01:52:43,200 --> 01:52:46,639
I can't talk to anyone else.

1042
01:52:47,840 --> 01:52:51,399
We are alps',,after all. Should
alps complain about hard duties?

1043
01:52:51,400 --> 01:52:53,599
e are alps, after all. Should
alps complain about hard duties?

1044
01:52:54,040 --> 01:52:55,639
They shouldn't.

1045
01:52:55,720 --> 01:52:59,999
They shouldn't talk but you understand me.

1046
01:53:02,920 --> 01:53:07,719
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

1047
01:53:14,600 --> 01:53:19,599
-Nothing. I was talking about
a problem with my companion.

1048
01:53:23,760 --> 01:53:28,839
Judging by how it seems,
it seems like a big problem.

1049
01:53:29,320 --> 01:53:31,999
I am ashamed of calling it a problem.

1050
01:53:32,080 --> 01:53:35,719
A duty... It is a big duty, but...

1051
01:53:36,200 --> 01:53:39,639
...do you know who I am?

1052
01:53:40,680 --> 01:53:44,759
Ghazi Alp, the son of Cerkutay, who was a spy.

1053
01:53:45,040 --> 01:53:49,759
Everyone in this marketplace
calls me "the son of a spy".

1054
01:53:49,840 --> 01:53:53,439
But I am Osman Bey's Alp.

1055
01:53:53,720 --> 01:53:59,079
No burden is too heavy for me. I can
fight with a sword and keep a secret.

1056
01:53:59,160 --> 01:54:03,599
It's obvious. You are a valiant warrior.

1057
01:54:03,920 --> 01:54:07,359
You are saying that you can keep a secret, huh?

1058
01:54:07,520 --> 01:54:14,519
Osman Bey is an important Bey
who fights on the way of Allah.

1059
01:54:14,720 --> 01:54:18,519
He follows the sunnah of the Messenger of Allah
(PBUH).

1060
01:54:19,240 --> 01:54:21,439
Did you know?

1061
01:54:21,520 --> 01:54:24,439
Our Efendi also had friends at your age.

1062
01:54:24,520 --> 01:54:27,399
Really?
-Really, yes.

1063
01:54:29,160 --> 01:54:35,679
The first Muslim child, the Shah
of honest men, Hadhrat Ali (RA).

1064
01:54:35,760 --> 01:54:38,759
I know him! Yes I do! He laid in
the Rasullullah's (PBUH) bed...

1065
01:54:38,880 --> 01:54:42,719
...and played a game against polytheists.
-Oh Praise be!

1066
01:54:44,360 --> 01:54:48,799
There was someone else. Anas ibn Malik.

1067
01:54:48,880 --> 01:54:51,759
Do you also know him?

1068
01:55:00,480 --> 01:55:03,959
Anas ibn Malik was an orphan.

1069
01:55:04,080 --> 01:55:08,479
In the hejira of our Prophet to Medina...

1070
01:55:08,640 --> 01:55:12,879
...his mother gave him to
the service of our Prophet.

1071
01:55:12,960 --> 01:55:19,479
He was 8 years old back then and he never
left his side until our Prophet's passing.

1072
01:55:22,840 --> 01:55:27,479
He was present in all battles. He
participated in the Battle of Badr...

1073
01:55:27,560 --> 01:55:30,399
...when he was only 12 years old.

1074
01:55:30,480 --> 01:55:34,799
But more importantly...

1075
01:55:36,680 --> 01:55:41,359
...Anas ibn Malik was the
confidant of our Prophet.

1076
01:55:42,320 --> 01:55:44,879
A child confidant.

1077
01:55:48,360 --> 01:55:52,519
Our Prophet would give
him his secrets and duties...

1078
01:55:52,600 --> 01:55:55,479
...and he never worried about them...

1079
01:55:55,560 --> 01:55:59,919
...because he knew that Anas ibn Malik...

1080
01:56:00,000 --> 01:56:03,039
...would always keep his secrets.

1081
01:56:03,360 --> 01:56:06,559
He was young..

1082
01:56:06,640 --> 01:56:08,959
...but his imaan was great.

1083
01:56:09,200 --> 01:56:13,479
No matter what happened, he
wouldn't tell anyone his secret...

1084
01:56:13,560 --> 01:56:18,319
...not even his mother. Even if
our Prophet's wives asked him...

1085
01:56:18,400 --> 01:56:22,119
...he wouldn't tell them. He wouldn't tell anyone.

1086
01:56:22,440 --> 01:56:25,879
Now you're saying that...

1087
01:56:25,960 --> 01:56:29,839
...you can keep Osman Bey's secret.

1088
01:56:30,120 --> 01:56:34,959
You are really lucky... you have...

1089
01:56:35,080 --> 01:56:39,639
...taken on an important duty for Osman
Bey's blessed way. But now you know that...

1090
01:56:39,960 --> 01:56:42,319
...you are not alone.

1091
01:56:42,480 --> 01:56:45,879
There were brave children like you in the past.

1092
01:56:46,000 --> 01:56:49,239
They were servants of Islam.

1093
01:56:50,120 --> 01:56:52,239
You are one of them.

1094
01:56:52,320 --> 01:56:56,079
-Am I really one of them?
-Yes.

1095
01:56:56,240 --> 01:57:00,919
And you... Dervish Efendi, who are you?

1096
01:57:02,640 --> 01:57:06,239
They call me Taptuk's Yunus.
-Taptuk’s Yunus?

1097
01:57:06,480 --> 01:57:09,119
Shahzades are always telling me your words’

1098
01:57:09,200 --> 01:57:12,359
Are you really Yunus Emre?

1099
01:57:18,960 --> 01:57:23,199
My companion is injured...
I treated its wound but...

1100
01:57:23,360 --> 01:57:27,919
..if you allow me, I want to entrust it to you.

1101
01:57:48,640 --> 01:57:53,079
Alaeddin Bey...
-Gonca Hatun.

1102
01:57:57,560 --> 01:57:58,799
Alps.

1103
01:58:05,840 --> 01:58:10,039
They said you went to Kutahya.

1104
01:58:10,160 --> 01:58:15,199
My father and my mother left. I am
at the marketplace with my brother.

1105
01:58:15,280 --> 01:58:17,559
Is that so?

1106
01:58:19,000 --> 01:58:22,839
It is forbidden for
Germiyanoglu to enter Yenisehir.

1107
01:58:22,960 --> 01:58:28,439
-What are you doing here?
-I am not here for a visit. I have things to say.

1108
01:58:29,720 --> 01:58:32,119
Tell me.

1109
01:58:35,480 --> 01:58:38,559
Alaeddin Bey. Tajeddin Noyan

1110
01:58:38,800 --> 01:58:43,639
...came to frontiers marketplace
last night. He talked to my brother.

1111
01:58:44,200 --> 01:58:49,879
I am afraid my brother is going to
make a mistake and unite with him.

1112
01:58:50,320 --> 01:58:53,399
What fitna are you trying to cause again?

1113
01:58:54,760 --> 01:58:58,999
Tell me... How am I going
to believe your words, huh?

1114
01:59:01,480 --> 01:59:07,359
I made one mistake. And I
am paying its price, Alaeddin.

1115
01:59:09,560 --> 01:59:14,199
I came here and put my life at
risk, against my brother's will.

1116
01:59:14,280 --> 01:59:17,519
I know that he is going to kill me.

1117
01:59:22,480 --> 01:59:27,359
You will bring Alaeddin's head to me. I
will make him experience the worst pain.

1118
01:59:27,520 --> 01:59:31,999
I will take his son from
him. Alaca will handle this.

1119
01:59:37,560 --> 01:59:40,359
I came.

1120
01:59:42,760 --> 01:59:47,119
...because I don’t want my
family to make another mistake.

1121
01:59:50,440 --> 01:59:52,879
I said what I had to say.

1122
01:59:53,120 --> 01:59:55,439
Now I am not responsible for that.

1123
01:59:55,600 --> 01:59:59,959
You can believe it or not.

1124
02:00:00,200 --> 02:00:02,279
Good.

1125
02:00:05,600 --> 02:00:09,199
I believe you.

1126
02:00:10,600 --> 02:00:13,999
Now go back to your marketplace.

1127
02:00:17,320 --> 02:00:22,879
-Alaeddin!
-Gonca!

1128
02:00:26,280 --> 02:00:30,359
Gonca!
-Tell me, Mehmet Bey.

1129
02:00:30,960 --> 02:00:33,999
Tajeddin Noyan came to see me.

1130
02:00:34,280 --> 02:00:38,279
He said "I will cut your head
off if you unite with Osman."

1131
02:00:38,360 --> 02:00:40,479
And..

1132
02:00:41,240 --> 02:00:43,999
...why are you telling me this?

1133
02:00:44,200 --> 02:00:47,959
I am obeying my father's orders.

1134
02:00:48,040 --> 02:00:51,679
He ordered me and said "Keep your
relationship good with Osman Bey."

1135
02:00:51,800 --> 02:00:55,879
Tajeddin Noyan will not
only cause problems for you...

1136
02:00:55,960 --> 02:00:58,959
...but also for me.

1137
02:00:59,440 --> 02:01:03,839
I wanted you to know that
and take your steps accordingly.

1138
02:01:04,600 --> 02:01:08,959
My Bey. Mehmet and Tajeddin Noyan met.

1139
02:01:09,040 --> 02:01:12,159
It seems they are after an alliance.

1140
02:01:12,480 --> 02:01:15,039
Oh Mehmet...

1141
02:01:15,120 --> 02:01:18,999
No one allies with Tajeddin Noyan.

1142
02:01:19,400 --> 02:01:25,919
He only looks for a dog to use for himself.

1143
02:01:32,280 --> 02:01:35,759
Go to the Frontier Marketplace.

1144
02:01:35,880 --> 02:01:40,119
Tajeddin Noyan will come
here. Don't let him see you here.

1145
02:01:40,440 --> 02:01:45,159
However, if he wants something from you..

1146
02:01:45,320 --> 02:01:50,199
-..inform me about it.
-Do not worry, Osman Bey.

1147
02:01:50,360 --> 02:01:54,199
I'll have my leave now.

1148
02:02:50,600 --> 02:02:53,319
He made his people just like himself.

1149
02:02:53,360 --> 02:02:57,199
The heads of these strongheads,
won't leave on their bodies for long.

1150
02:02:57,280 --> 02:03:00,399
Wrong. On the contrary..

1151
02:03:00,560 --> 02:03:04,519
..these are the hardest ones to crush.

1152
02:03:04,720 --> 02:03:06,639
Come on.

1153
02:03:09,600 --> 02:03:13,359
These people believe in their leader so much..

1154
02:03:13,520 --> 02:03:19,319
..that you can not crush them
before crushing their belief.

1155
02:03:37,920 --> 02:03:41,279
Pity, they became blind.

1156
02:03:41,360 --> 02:03:47,359
However, I will show them the truth.

1157
02:03:47,640 --> 02:03:50,879
Come on!

1158
02:04:38,960 --> 02:04:45,079
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

1159
02:04:47,400 --> 02:04:50,079
So, Osman Bey..

1160
02:04:50,280 --> 02:04:56,039
..I hope you will give the good news.

1161
02:04:57,800 --> 02:05:02,879
Have you decided yet?
-I decided long ago.

1162
02:05:03,760 --> 02:05:08,079
I am curiously waiting for
your response. However..

1163
02:05:08,160 --> 02:05:12,959
..I have information for you.

1164
02:05:15,200 --> 02:05:20,919
Princess Maria, whom you kept
away from me, is in my hands.

1165
02:05:22,880 --> 02:05:25,079
I know.

1166
02:05:27,120 --> 02:05:31,039
However, you should hear this as well.

1167
02:05:32,320 --> 02:05:36,079
I will never bow down to you.

1168
02:05:38,000 --> 02:05:41,239
I will never pay any tax to you.

1169
02:05:43,000 --> 02:05:47,959
And if you want a single alp from me..

1170
02:05:48,040 --> 02:05:52,799
..you will never get it. Know this well.

1171
02:05:53,520 --> 02:05:57,079
You are making a mistake, Osman Bey.

1172
02:05:58,920 --> 02:06:03,159
Think about what will happen.

1173
02:06:05,760 --> 02:06:12,599
You are threatening the lives of..

1174
02:06:13,080 --> 02:06:16,079
..Gunduz Bey and Ayca
Hatun, whom you care so much.

1175
02:06:18,440 --> 02:06:23,479
I don't threaten anyone's life.

1176
02:06:24,960 --> 02:06:28,519
Bring them!

1177
02:06:48,880 --> 02:06:54,079
Do you think you are the only one playing tricks?

1178
02:06:58,560 --> 02:07:04,519
We got away from your
hands for now, Tajeddin Noyan.

1179
02:07:04,920 --> 02:07:10,959
However, we will stand against you soon.

1180
02:07:14,720 --> 02:07:17,679
You impressed me, Osman Bey.

1181
02:07:17,760 --> 02:07:21,479
However, my patience has ran out.

1182
02:07:21,600 --> 02:07:24,319
Know this well.

1183
02:07:25,280 --> 02:07:29,599
If war will start..

1184
02:07:29,680 --> 02:07:33,159
..this will not be good for you at all.

1185
02:07:35,840 --> 02:07:38,759
e are not afraid of death.

1186
02:07:39,000 --> 02:07:42,399
We live with death.

1187
02:07:46,280 --> 02:07:50,639
Bring the Karacelasun dog

1188
02:08:36,200 --> 02:08:39,839
You will hold this dog's leash.

1189
02:08:45,240 --> 02:08:48,799
Since you put him among us to play your tricks..

1190
02:08:49,120 --> 02:08:51,879
..killing this dog does not fit me.

1191
02:09:00,280 --> 02:09:02,479
Osman, for the final time..

1192
02:09:02,560 --> 02:09:05,919
Shut it!

1193
02:09:08,680 --> 02:09:12,039
Shut it!

1194
02:09:15,960 --> 02:09:20,519
Keep that worm tongue of yours to yourself!

1195
02:09:20,800 --> 02:09:26,399
You oppressed the innocent.
You raised your hand to them!

1196
02:09:29,400 --> 02:09:35,559
Didn't you have no shame
when you laid down for sajdah?

1197
02:09:40,080 --> 02:09:43,359
Which book was it written what you did?

1198
02:09:44,680 --> 02:09:47,199
My name is Osman Bey.

1199
02:09:47,520 --> 02:09:53,279
I will never bow down to you!

1200
02:10:01,480 --> 02:10:07,839
If war is what you want, there
is the field, there are the soldiers.

1201
02:10:08,120 --> 02:10:11,519
Do not fall back.
-Osman.

1202
02:10:11,680 --> 02:10:17,879
I will make you pay for this.

1203
02:10:36,880 --> 02:10:41,439
From now on, you won't be able to breathe freely.

1204
02:10:41,520 --> 02:10:46,359
I won't stop until every
single person in this city dies.

1205
02:10:46,840 --> 02:10:51,839
I will make you
live in hell, Osman!

1206
02:10:52,640 --> 02:10:57,639
Threats are for jackals. Don't fall back!

1207
02:11:23,560 --> 02:11:26,819
Beys! Alps!

1208
02:11:34,480 --> 02:11:37,479
The great war has started!

1209
02:11:37,680 --> 02:11:42,079
Now, ride your horses to the north..

1210
02:11:42,240 --> 02:11:48,039
..to the east, to the west and to the south!

1211
02:11:48,160 --> 02:11:52,839
Send word to Turk tribes and beys!

1212
02:11:52,920 --> 02:11:57,359
Tell them, the war of existence has started!

1213
02:11:57,440 --> 02:12:00,119
The era of peace is over!

1214
02:12:00,280 --> 02:12:03,119
From now on, it’s time to rise up!

1215
02:12:06,000 --> 02:12:18,759
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

1216
02:12:20,200 --> 02:12:21,239
Oh Allah

1217
02:12:24,038 --> 02:12:36,128
Visit turkision.com for more!